==Danish==
[[File:Åbningstider, Stadsbiblioteket i Lyngby, 2016-04-17.JPG|thumb|"Mandag". Opening hours for a Danish library displayed on a window with "Mandag" near the top.]]

===Etymology===
From {{etyl|gmq-oda|da}} {{m|gmq-oda|mandagh}}, from {{etyl|non|da}} {{m|non|mánadagr}}, from late {{etyl|gem-pro|da}} {{m|gem-pro|*mēniniz dagaz}}, a calque of Latin {{m|la|dies lunae}}. Compare Norwegian Bokmål {{m|nb|mandag}}, Swedish and Norwegian Nynorsk {{m|nn|måndag}}, Icelandic {{m|is|mánudagur}}, Faroese {{m|fo|mánadagur}}.

===Pronunciation===
* {{IPA|/ˈmanˀda/|lang=da}}
* {{rhymes|a|lang=da}}

